---
import LeadForm from './LeadForm';
import { getBrokers, twinsSortedByTer } from '../lib/pairs';
import { formatTer } from '../lib/format';

const twins = twinsSortedByTer('sp500');
const broker = getBrokers()[0];
const steps = broker.steps.value.slice(0, 3);
---
<section id="navod" data-section="navod" class="section guide">
  <h2>Co je v návodu</h2>
  <p class="section__lead">PDF, 3–4 strany. Stáhnete si ho hned po odeslání a pošleme ho i na váš e-mail.</p>

  <div class="guide__split">
    <!-- Stylised pages in HTML (real text, no images); decorative, the list below says the same. -->
    <div class="guide__pages" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="page">
        <p class="page__title">Jak koupit S&amp;P 500 a další americké indexy u vašeho brokera</p>
        <table class="page__table">
          <tbody>
            {twins.map((f) => (
              <tr>
                <td class:list={['page__tk', f.ter.value === twins[0].ter.value && 'page__tk--low']}>{f.id}</td>
                <td class="page__num">{formatTer(f.ter.value)}</td>
                <td class="page__num">{f.isin.value}</td>
              </tr>
            ))}
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <div class="page__lines"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="page page--2">
        <p class="page__title">{broker.name}: postup krok za krokem</p>
        {steps.length > 0 && (
          <ol class="page__steps">
            {steps.map((s) => <li>{s}</li>)}
          </ol>
        )}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="guide__text">
      <ul class="guide__list check-list">
        <li>Pro XTB, Trading 212 a Degiro: poplatek za nákup, postup krok za krokem a která dvojčata broker nabízí, s ISIN a tickerem k vyhledání. U Fio zatím poplatek a obecný postup, dostupnost fondů jsme neověřili.</li>
        <li>Tabulka všech párů originál → dvojče s TER a ISIN.</li>
        <li>Akumulace vs. distribuce a co to znamená pro daně v ČR (časový test).</li>
        <li>Údaje o brokerech ověřujeme na jejich stránkách; datum ověření je uvedené v návodu.</li>
      </ul>

      <LeadForm client:visible placement="preview" pair="sp500" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  @use '../styles/tokens' as *;

  // Mobil: náhled → seznam → formulář; desktop: náhled vlevo, text a formulář vpravo.
  .guide__split {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 32px;

    @media (min-width: 900px) {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
      align-items: center;
      gap: 64px;
    }
  }

  // Two A4 sheets on a quiet --cloud panel, slightly turned, the second overlapping the first.
  .guide__pages {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 32px 18px 40px;
    border-radius: $radius-card;
    background: $cloud;

    @media (min-width: 900px) { padding: 56px 40px 64px; }
  }

  .page {
    flex: none;
    width: 46%;
    max-width: 210px;
    aspect-ratio: 210 / 297;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 7% 6%;
    border: 1px solid $line;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: $white;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 24px -14px rgba(15, 34, 87, 0.35);
    color: $ink;
    font-size: 8px;
    line-height: 1.35;
    transform: rotate(-3deg);

    p { margin: 0; }

    &--2 {
      position: relative;
      margin: 24px 0 0 -6%;
      transform: rotate(3deg);
    }
  }

  .page__title {
    margin-bottom: 0.9em !important;
    color: $night;
    font-family: $font-display;
    font-size: 8.5px;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.2;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .page__table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 7px;

    td {
      padding: 0.35em 0;
      border-top: 1px solid $line;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 1px solid $line; }
  }

  .page__num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

  .page__tk {
    padding-inline: 0.4em !important;
    border-radius: 3px;
    color: $euro-d;
    font-family: $font-display;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .page__tk--low { color: $night; background: $gold; }

  .page__num { text-align: right; padding-left: 0.6em !important; }

  // Body-copy placeholder strokes below the table (the text would be too small to read anyway).
  .page__lines {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.7em;
    margin-top: 1.2em;

    span { display: block; height: 3px; border-radius: 2px; background: $cloud; }
    span:nth-child(2n) { width: 82%; }
  }

  .page__steps {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.3em;
    font-size: 7px;
    line-height: 1.4;

    li + li { margin-top: 0.5em; }
    li::marker { color: $euro-d; font-weight: 700; }
  }

  .guide__list { margin: 0 0 28px; }

  .guide :global(.lead-form) { max-width: none; }
</style>
